 252:Eigen/src/Core/CwiseNullaryOp.h ****   * Output: \verbinclude DenseBase_LinSpaced.out
 253:Eigen/src/Core/CwiseNullaryOp.h ****   *
 254:Eigen/src/Core/CwiseNullaryOp.h ****   * For integer scalar types, an even spacing is possible if and only if the length of the range,
 255:Eigen/src/Core/CwiseNullaryOp.h ****   * i.e., \c high-low is a scalar multiple of \c size-1, or if \c size is a scalar multiple of the
 256:Eigen/src/Core/CwiseNullaryOp.h ****   * number of values \c high-low+1 (meaning each value can be repeated the same number of time).
